        "content": "<p>Hello all,</p>\n<p>I have been thinking about prime numbers for many years.</p>\n<p>I am looking to find a welcoming community in which to have discussions and get expert opinions. </p>\n<p>I am new to this process and appreciate any recommendations. Specifically interested at the moment on the Hardy-Littlewood prime k-tuples. </p>\n<p>Hope you all are having a good day,<br>\nGeoff</p>",
